  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Monochromatic light of frequency <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f_{1}\"></span> is incident on the surface of a metal. The stopping voltage for this light is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"V_{1}\"></span>. When the frequency of the radiation is changed to <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f_{2}\"></span>, the stopping voltage is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"V_{2}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is the quantity <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{V_{2}-V_{1}}{f_{2}-f_{1}}\"></span> equal to?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"h\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{h}{e}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{h}{c}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{hc}{e}\"></span></li></ol>"
